OL,3,GNEWSAMost of councils' special needs
OL,4,Adebts written off
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has agreed to write off
OL,7,Fmillions of pounds worth of council
OL,8,Fdebts.
OL,10,FThe deficit resulted from spending on
OL,11,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,12,Fin Central Bedfordshire and
OL,13,FHertfordshire.
OL,15,FThe councils in both areas had to have
OL,16,Fplans to reform special educational
OL,17,Fneeds and disabilities (SEND) services
OL,18,Fapproved by the government to qualify
OL,19,Ffor the help.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
